<title>POLAND: Jutrzenka sells one mln new shares.</title>
<headline>Jutrzenka sells one mln new shares.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish confectioner Jutrzenka SA sold all one million new shares offered in a public subscription, the company said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>The issue was priced at 67 zlotys per share.</p>
<p>Jutrzenka said the shares were allotted to seven investors but did not give any other details.</p>
<p>On Friday Jutrzenka traded at 66.5 zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
